  repository: https://github.com/SuperDisk/hUGEDriver
  commit:     a3cbd0cea48e6784d7f625066d0300f7cb075926 (2024-07-14, "Allow force run
              of build"), the driver hUGETracker 1.0.11 ships (its src/hUGEDriver
              submodule at v1.0.11, 0623f3f7; the release's
              hUGETracker.app/Contents/Resources/hUGEDriver/hUGEDriver.asm has the
              same sha256)
  files:      hUGEDriver.asm, include/hUGE.inc, include/hUGE_note_table.inc
  sha256:     hUGEDriver.asm        16870fd80f764e9d64aa098d5a7ebdc5d5d48033ca080a121a7d11c3e2e01d56
              hUGE.inc              fc9c768337328ffaf518beaa7cee0e212db6fcd12bfe2fca7df254213a6e77cd
              hUGE_note_table.inc   624d1364facea8e5deea26b15eff3f625ed19f22a3bae322790dc2bdac55099c
  fetched:    2026-11-07, the GitHub tarball of the commit (gh api .../tarball/<commit>)
  license:    public domain. The repository has no LICENSE file; its README.md ends
